/Subject (The new S12XS family of 16-bit micro controllers is a compatible, reduced version of the S12XE family. Targeted at generic automotive applications and CAN nodes, some typical examples of these applications are: Body Controllers, Occupant Detection, Door Modules, RKE Receivers, Smart Actuators, Lighting Modules and Smart Junction Boxes amongst many others. Covers MC9S12XS Family MC9S12XS256, MC9S12XS128, MC9S12XS64.)
